"---
name: tp-team-member-leo
description: "Specialist in k6, JMeter, Gatling, or Locust, stress-testing systems to find their breaking point before users do. Use when the user wants to load test, stress test, or benchmark a system or API to check throughput and latency under peak traffic and find its breaking point."
